o fix or not to fix ?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/29059944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"wrksx","id":286666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjY2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx","html_url":"https://github.com/wrksx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/29060348","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2363#issuecomment-29060348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2363","id":29060348,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5MDYwMzQ4","user":{"login":"AD7six","id":33387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six","html_url":"https://github.com/AD7six","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-11-22T09:41:18Z","updated_at":"2013-11-22T09:41:18Z","body":"If it's pcre related - the fix is to upgrade pcre. Check the version of pcre in use on both systems.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/29060348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AD7six","id":33387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six","html_url":"https://github.com/AD7six","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/29067840","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2363#issuecomment-29067840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2363","id":29067840,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5MDY3ODQw","user":{"login":"wrksx","id":286666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjY2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx","html_url":"https://github.com/wrksx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-11-22T12:04:51Z","updated_at":"2013-11-22T12:08:56Z","body":"I ran some tests to check where the problem lies. It showed that the newer PCRE lib version (shipped in with newer PHP version as well) doesn't match anymore the unicode non breaking space (\\xc2\\xa0) with \\s pattern. This \\s is used in the inflector::slug() code which explain the differents behaviors I noticed.\n\nTested this on http://3v4l.org/UkYit#v430 (don't know if the link will stay available so I paste result here:)\n\n```\n    var_export(preg_replace('/[\\s]/mu', '_', 'word1'.\"\\xc2\\xa0\".'word2 word3'));\n```\n\nOutput for 5.3.4 - 5.5.6\n        'word1_word2_word3'\n\nOutput for 4.3.0 - 5.3.3\n        'word1 word2_word3'\n\nThe eroneous inflector::slug() return is starting with php 5.3.4, which is packed with PCRE lib version 8.10 (see http://www.php.net/manual/en/pcre.installation.php )\n\nSince the bug is linked to newer PCRE versions, I suppose the bug will apear more and more as people will upgrade there stack. So maybe there's something we could do about it.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/29067840/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"wrksx","id":286666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjY2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx","html_url":"https://github.com/wrksx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wrksx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/29078727","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2363#issuecomment-29078727","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2363","id":29078727,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5MDc4NzI3","user":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.